From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mythiccal <cwood2014.cw@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 15:11:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Async Chunk Sending

Offloads chunk packet serialization to a thread pool. Anti-Xray modified
chunks remain on the synchronous path.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

diff --git a/net/minecraft/network/protocol/game/ClientboundLevelChunkPacketData.java b/net/minecraft/network/protocol/game/ClientboundLevelChunkPacketData.java
